    {0x60ece51f7e7e28caull, {"...Tch. You made a fool of me.\nLook forward to next time.", "...Tss. Tu m'as humili&'ee.\nJ'ai h&^ate de te revoir.", "...Tsk. Du hast mich blamiert.\nFreu dich aufs n&~achste Mal.", "...Tsk. Mi hai fatto fare una figuraccia.\nVedrai la prossima volta.", "...Tsk. Me has dejado en rid&'iculo.\nYa ver&'as la pr&'oxima vez que nos veamos."}},  // fa2g1201#5
    {0x60f212129bdd6c56ull, {"No...! If only I'd gone to help back then...", "Non...! Si j'&'etais all&'e les aider...", "Nein...! H&~atte ich damals nur geholfen...", "No...! Se solo fossi andato ad aiutarli...", "&~!No...! Si hubiera ido a ayudarles..."}},  // ca1c9201#3
    {0x60f56198a2891684ull, {"To do so, we must first join up\nwith the civilian transport ship Atlantis", "Pour cela, nous devons d'abord rejoindre\nle transporteur civil Atlantis", "Dazu treffen wir uns zun&~achst mit\ndem zivilen Transportschiff Atlantis", "Per farlo, dobbiamo prima unirci\nalla nave da trasporto civile Atlantis", "Para ello, primero debemos reunirnos\ncon la nave de transporte civil Atlantis"}},  // fa2c1401#3
